{
  "title": "Jak přispívat",
  "content": "\n<p>Je to jednoduché. Napiště mě o přístup na <strong>michal.valny@gmail.com</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Dostanete jméno a heslo a přihlásíte se zde:  <a href=\"https://mervin-cz.com/wp-login\">https://mervin-cz.com/wp-login</a> Po přihlášení uvidíte stránku kde vlevo kliknete na <strong>Příspěvky</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"649\" src=\"http://3.123.224.240/wp-content/uploads/image-1024x649.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3394\" srcset=\"https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-1024x649.png 1024w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-300x190.png 300w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-768x487.png 768w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image.png 1430w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Na další stránce klepnete na <strong>Vytvořit příspěvek</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"579\" src=\"http://3.123.224.240/wp-content/uploads/image-1-1024x579.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3395\" srcset=\"https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-1-1024x579.png 1024w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-1-300x170.png 300w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-1-768x434.png 768w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-1.png 1312w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Pak už jen píšete a píšete&#8230;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Jakmile jste hotovi, kliknete na Publikovat a je to!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"397\" src=\"http://3.123.224.240/wp-content/uploads/image-2-1024x397.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3397\" srcset=\"https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-2-1024x397.png 1024w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-2-300x116.png 300w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-2-768x298.png 768w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-2.png 1910w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Jak vložit obrázek</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Máte několik možností:</p>\n\n\n\n<p>A. Copy+Paste normálně do textu.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>B. Po odřádkování v textu kliknout na tlačítko obrázku nebo galerie.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"834\" height=\"282\" src=\"http://3.123.224.240/wp-content/uploads/image-3.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3399\" srcset=\"https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-3.png 834w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-3-300x101.png 300w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-3-768x260.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 834px) 100vw, 834px\" /><figcaption><br></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Následně pak vybrat obrázek nebo více obrázků z disku.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"843\" height=\"422\" src=\"http://3.123.224.240/wp-content/uploads/image-4.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3400\" srcset=\"https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-4.png 843w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-4-300x150.png 300w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-4-768x384.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 843px) 100vw, 843px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>C. Vytvořit si Album Google a vložit do textu odkaz. Normálně v textu odřádkujete a klepnete na tlačítko závorek.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"857\" height=\"280\" src=\"http://3.123.224.240/wp-content/uploads/image-5.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3401\" srcset=\"https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-5.png 857w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-5-300x98.png 300w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-5-768x251.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 857px) 100vw, 857px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Do okna pak vložíte přesně t co je níže, akorát žlutá část je adresa vašeho alba.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"873\" height=\"366\" src=\"http://3.123.224.240/wp-content/uploads/image-6.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3402\" srcset=\"https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-6.png 873w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-6-300x126.png 300w, https://www.mervin-cz.com/wp-content/uploads/image-6-768x322.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 873px) 100vw, 873px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
  "slug": "jak-prispivat"
}